  "title": "Maui MPO 2045 long-range transportation plan",
  "summary": "On November 25, the board approved the executive director's changes to the long-range transportation plan action plan, calling for a full 2045 update that reflects the West Maui long-term recovery plan and adopts its transportation projects. A draft goes to the board in February, with adoption set before April 15. The current plan expires at the end of this year, and without a valid plan the board cannot amend its TIP.",
